                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>. Click any country on the map to see its trend line. Countries producing consistently high-rated players represent strong recruitment markets.</run>
